Z||000006||fiero56||03-13-2001||09:56 PM||||I have to respectfully disagree with you Ogre. I know you are a man who goes by the books, and I usually believe everything you have to say, but, I have an e-mail Ed Parks posted on the egroups list on 5, Oct 2000, talking about the auto having 4 different FD ratios(2.84, 3.06, 3.14, 3.33), and I value Ed's words higher than most any other person. <P>Here is part of that message:<P>"Interesting also is the fact that auto trans had a total of 4 different<BR>final drives in various years/engines.<P>2.84, 3.06, 3.14, and 3.33.<P>A little "mixing" can produce instant results!!<P>Ed Parks    (The Fiero Factory)<BR>8710B Hwy 53, Toney, Ala 35773<BR>Shop # 256-420-5391    Hm # 256-882-1568 <A HREF="http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory" TARGET=_blank>http://www.welcome.to/thefierofactory</A> "<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 03-14-2001).]||||reg||1
